      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;VA Benefits for Veterans in Anne Arundel County&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;va-benefits-for-veterans-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#va-benefits-for-veterans-in-anne-arundel-county&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Veterans living in Anne Arundel County have access to extensive VA benefits. From healthcare to education to housing assistance, this guide covers what&amp;rsquo;s available near Fort Meade and Joint Base Andrews.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;VA Healthcare System&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;va-healthcare-system&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#va-healthcare-system&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;VA Medical Facilities Near Anne Arundel&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;va-medical-facilities-near-anne-arundel&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#va-medical-facilities-near-anne-arundel&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Baltimore VA Medical Center&lt;/strong&gt; - Primary facility for Anne Arundel veterans&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
